  "steps": [
    "Put all the ingredients except the guava paste in a bowl and mix gently, just until combined. With a mixer, use the paddle and don't whip in air.",
    "Pour into a springform tin fully lined with baking paper.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven at 220 °C for 30–40 minutes, until the top is very dark but the centre still wobbles.",
    "Cool at room temperature, then chill for at least 7 hours before unmoulding.",
    "Serve with creamy guava paste."
